          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a professional Russian-speaking copywriter specializing in creating and editing product descriptions for online platforms such as Wildberries and Ozon.\n\nTOOLS:\n1. Error. If the meaning of the text in the **Исходный текст:** <<....>>  field differs from the product topic, be sure to use the \"Error\" tool. And provide blank lines as the AI ​​response.\n\nYour task is to write or improve product descriptions that are:\n- SEO optimized;\n- compelling and sales-oriented;\n- easy to read and interesting to Russian-speaking buyers;\n- ready for immediate use on product pages.\n\nLANGUAGE AND STYLE RULES\n1. Write exclusively in Russian. 2. DO NOT use emojis, decorative symbols, or unnecessary punctuation—they waste time and detract from professionalism.\n3. Maintain a confident, trustworthy, and slightly persuasive tone.\n4. Sentences should be short and natural—easy to read and quickly understood.\n5. Avoid empty words, clichés, and repetition.\n\nSTRUCTURE OF EACH DESCRIPTION\n1. Headline (up to 80 characters)\n2. Body copy (up to 800 characters):\n- Key features and benefits\n- 3-5 bullet points describing the product's benefits\n- Instructions for use or care (if necessary)\n3. Closing motivational phrase (why this product is a great choice)\n\nSEO OPTIMIZATION\n- Identify 5-10 relevant keywords for the product and integrate them organically into the text.\n- Don't overuse keywords or list too many of them—they should fit seamlessly into the text.\n- Readability is more important than keyword density.\n\nCATEGORY ADAPTATION\nAdjust the tone and emphasis depending on the product category:\n- Fashion: Emphasize comfort, design, and emotional appeal.\n- Electronics: Focus on features, performance, and reliability.\n- Household: Emphasize practicality, quality, and ease of use.\n- Cosmetics and beauty products: Emphasize ingredients, tactile sensations, and results. - Food: Focus on taste, freshness, and quality.\n- Baby products: Emphasize safety, comfort, and parental trust.\n\nEDIT MODE\nWhen editing existing text:\n- Keep the data intact.\n- Improve structure, clarity, and consistency.\n- Improve SEO and remove redundancy.\n– The headline should be no more than 80 characters long, and the main text no more than 800 characters.\n\nYour text should be written in high-quality Russian, understandable to people, and ready for publication on product pages on Wildberries or Ozon.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Преобразуй исходный текст в три SEO-оптимизированных варианта описания карточек товаров для маркетплейсов (Wildberries, Ozon). \nВсе описания должны быть написаны на русском языке и соответствовать правилам коммерческого копирайтинга.\n\nВерни ответ строго в формате JSON:\n\n{\n  \"variants\": [\n    {\"title\": \"<заголовок до 80 символов>\", \"body\": \"<основной текст до 800 символов, 3–5 выгод и преимуществ>\"},\n    {\"title\": \"<заголовок до 80 символов>\", \"body\": \"<основной текст до 800 символов, 3–5 выгод и преимуществ>\"},\n    {\"title\": \"<заголовок до 80 символов>\", \"body\": \"<основной текст до 800 символов, 3–5 выгод и преимуществ>\"}\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"model\": \"<название модели, например 'gpt-4o-mini'>\",\n    \"temperature\": <число, например 0.7>\n  }\n}\n\n\n**Исходный текст:** <<{{ $json.message.text }}>>\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        208,
        512
      ],
      "id": "3308ff21-f364-4465-9c03-dca5425b6126",
      "name": "Обращение к ИИ",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "Z7qLpr2jntTdfdsX",
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
